    "slug": "daihatsu-indonesia-official-2022-2024",
    "description": "As part of the design team, I contributed to the redesign of Daihatsu Indonesia?s official website in 2021. The project aimed to enhance user experience and refresh the brand?s digital presence with a modern, dynamic look aligned with Daihatsu?s identity.\n\nResponsibilities and Contributions:\n\n-\nConducted user requirement analysis to identify user needs and business objectives.\n\n-\nOrganized and restructured the information architecture and content grouping for better navigation flow.\n\n-\nDeveloped a comprehensive design system in Figma , including:\n\n-\nDefining font styles , font sizes , and color variables consistent with Daihatsu?s branding.\n\n-\nImplementing auto layout and creating dynamic components for design efficiency.\n\n-\nMaximizing Figma features to streamline collaboration and developer handoff.\n\n-\nCreated low- to high-fidelity prototypes to validate design flow and visual hierarchy.\n\n-\nThe final UI design was implemented and used by Daihatsu Indonesia from 2021 to 2023 , until their next major visual update.\n\nOutcome:\nThe redesigned website delivered a cleaner, more engaging, and user-friendly experience while maintaining strong brand consistency across Daihatsu?s digital presence.",
